[{"id":2611125965,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bop7N","user":{"login":"ZanyaNova","id":143202367,"node_id":"U_kgDOCIkYPw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143202367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova","html_url":"https://github.com/ZanyaNova","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanyaNova/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Really hoping this becomes a thing! I'm terrible with naming things correctly on my first pass.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102380#pullrequestreview-2611125965","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102380","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102380#pullrequestreview-2611125965"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102380"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-12T08:13:41Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2788156558,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6mL-SO","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally on the [3D platformer demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/platformer), it mostly works as expected.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- If you select a word by double-clicking or <kbd>Ctrl + D</kbd> then try to use <kbd>F2</kbd> or right-click -> **Rename Symbol**, it won't work:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a497f0f4-4d6b-4bf2-9187-d5527291787b)\r\n\r\nThis is likely because the rename action works if the caret is within the word, but not at the end of the word. However, selecting by double-clicking or <kbd>Ctrl + D</kbd> always puts the caret at the end of the word. Incindentally, it will currently work if there's a punctuation character or line break just after the symbol (but not if there's a space).\r\n\r\n- The rename field should use the same code font as the script editor for consistency:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f2c66a6e-769c-4472-b696-9e4192de82bf)\r\n\r\n- If you try to rename a symbol that can't be renamed (e.g. a method on a core engine type), a small popup will appear below the caret for a split second and the script editor will lose focus. Pressing <kbd>F2</kbd> again will rename the currently selected node in the Scene tree dock due to this:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43f1c982-146e-4776-80c7-7d9953168a8f\r\n\r\n- It's possible to create syntactically incorrect code by renaming a symbol to an invalid identifier, e.g. replacing `taken` with `taken 123` in this example. There should probably be a check for the value in the text field being a valid identifier, and disabling the Rename button if it's invalid.\r\n\r\n- Undo/redo functionality doesn't seem to work correctly, even though history entries are created:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bac3c7d-136d-4bca-a4b3-6f8fc4cda883)\r\n\r\nIf I press <kbd>Ctrl + Z</kbd>, nothing happens. However, selecting history entries will correctly go back to the previous state, providing the renamed value is a correct identifier (if not, words will be mangled around).","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102380#pullrequestreview-2788156558","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102380","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102380#pullrequestreview-2788156558"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102380"}},"submitted_at":"2025-04-23T17:14:28Z","commit_id":"4e278ced9127b2bc03e2990000ac0ce0b3a212cf"},{"id":2794497564,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6mkKYc","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?u=a5fd9a203c90bd196083e33bbf0e21324e8c68f8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_ur