://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- I can confirm the issue @YeldhamDev noticed with the incorrect popup position, regardless of whether **Single Window Mode** is enabled in the Editor Settings. I'm on Linux with X11.\r\n\r\n- If you follow this scenario:\r\n  - Rename an identifier to something invalid.\r\n  - Press <kbd>Ctrl + Z</kbd> once to try to undo the change (it won't do anything, except move your caret).\r\n  - Fix the script error manually.\r\n  - Press <kbd>F2</kbd> while an identifier is selected (or when the caret is anywhere on an identifier).\r\n  - Then it won't show the refactor/rename dialog until you restart the editor (reloading the scene or closing/reopening the script won't suffice). It hides the caret, and nothing happens if I type some text and press <kbd>Enter</kbd>.\r\n\r\n- It's possible to enter invalid or reserved identifiers in the rename dialog (e.g. `something like this` or `Vector4`), which will cause script errors. Since the refactor currently can't be undone with <kbd>Ctrl + Z</kbd>, this can be quite damaging.\r\n  - I suggest only allowing valid identifiers, and checking whether it's reserved (built-in engine type or keyword) before accepting the rename.\r\n  - The changes from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102380#issuecomment-2895419274 no longer seem to be in this PR? The same goes for syntax highlighting, which no longer happens when entering known identifiers like user types.\r\n\r\n- Leading and trailing whitespace should be trimmed from the string to rename to, using `String.strip_edges()`.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102380#pullrequestreview-3378975329","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102380","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102380#pullrequestreview-3378975329"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102380"}},"submitted_at":"2025-10-24T21:44:21Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2592133932,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6agNMs","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102380#pullrequestreview